From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:54:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] POC-10b: Busting Level, Capture Grade, chip rewards, EXP
 scaling

BN6's busting score adapted to grid battles (time by turns or seconds via
PKBN_BUST_CLOCK, both logged; stun/push hits, steps, chain size, counter hits,
no faint). Rewards use BN6's tier table on a 20-entry list generated from the
enemy's own moves: money, HP, or a chip of its move (into the pack). S scales
EXP x1.2, <=3 x0.9. Catches get a Capture Grade (HP left, status, balls,
critical catch) and a chip whose code depends on the ball (Master Ball: every
move). New 'COUNTER HIT!' when hitting a busy enemy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
